OL,3,ASpaces in male prisons fall to lowest
OL,4,Alevel of year, sources say
OL,5,
OL,6,FJustice Secretary Alex Norris told the
OL,7,FCommons on Tuesday the scheme, which
OL,8,Fwas launched to reduce prison
OL,9,Fovercrowding, is needed to maintain
OL,10,Fconfidence in British justice.
